    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0aabe860647dea5aea2c8fe2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我目前正在研究社会性动物的根源部分。\n也就是所谓的“情感”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5e1d65fc71005c6efc67cba129fb4d8d68292eab2118a5530170750159ee85a5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
