      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……因为我受到了无预警的一击。\n从“有马纪念”的观众席上。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2d3c3179fc7996984b1b47344ecacea6726f00eaea69690865d9d080e7c37abc",
