      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "那一天，当我第一个抵达终点后……\n现场响起了爆炸般的欢呼声。",
      "source_fingerprint": "07c3eb49bf103202154db00710b3c8440665dc0c098be2293edefb6d58afaa56",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
