      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "那是让我全身发麻，打从心底感到震惊的\n压倒性力量。我整个人都呆了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "85004bd954a388d2b1445d532eb748c0760c5b9e46e5ede0103e891aa7e7e9c0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
