      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "──然后我现在跑出了成果。\n不对，应该是指经典赛之后的比赛，\n我靠自己的脚完成这件事。",
      "source_fingerprint": "30567967fdaef0eb6be6b8038c92bdf25814466f2ca8ef951bf173f8307526a4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
