    {
      "uid": "zhcn:01b6145e728f39651ec80c92",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "爱丽速子这么说着，\n眯起眼睛看向我。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b63612827e986776e357df5ffd8f46aa7c74793ed6d96a5a1b454e7efefda035",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
