      "uid": "zhcn:7c812800529048549729ac81",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“后院的土里埋着某个东西。\n你认为里面埋了什么呢？”",
      "source_fingerprint": "029c3749f7bd955772455361a6124b7993f8e0830135f246c38b877c6f67ebfd",
